me": "screenshot1.png", "id": "1878779380199730", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604370996_1878779383533063_3398222135293640705_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9q0JJVD0PJkQ7kNvwHh-5EM&_nc_oc=Adpj-b6_L7kfiTJSP0U3ao6MLwyFMVfvfb30McRoTq85hToBubPu0WADrhWVs26slGg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS1poSus7CvVel2FTyvrBdg8NLuOrt3D1O-Hwz2yfogmA&oe=6AF5EC43"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "ChronoMonki's", "keywords": ["Multiplayer", "Action"], "long_description": "Welcome to ChronoMonki's, the ultimate physics-based VR playground where your hands are your feet! Master a unique arm-based locomotion system that requires momentum, timing, and skill to navigate vibrant environments. No joysticks, no teleporting\u2014just pure, physical movement that lets you run, jump, and swing like a real primate.\n\n# CORE FEATURES: \n\n- Unique Physics Locomotion: Use your hands to push off surfaces, climb massive obstacles, and swing through the air with complete control.\n\n- Intense Tag Action: Chase your friends or flee from the infected monki in fast-paced, high-stakes multiplayer lobbies.\n\n- Competitive Ranked System: Push your parkour and tag skills to the limit, climb the leaderboards, and prove to the community that you are the absolute best monki around.\n\n- Social Playgrounds: Hang out, chat with other players using real-time voice chat, and practice your movement techniques in casual lobbies.\n\n\n_*Do you have the speed and agility to dominate the trees? Drop in, start swinging, and claim your crown!*_", "short_description": "This is a game that uses a special locomotino primarily involving your hands... just like a monki! swing run, tag and rank up to show everyone that you are the best monki!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/BTrack-monke/ChronoMonkis-PrivacyPolicy/blob/main/README.md", "developer_terms_of_s